{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202235","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202235","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120223501:1":{"text":"안녕하세요! 특별한 이유가 있어서 초코보의 깃털이 좀 필요한대요...","source_cn":"你好！因为一些特殊的原因，我们需要一些陆行鸟的羽毛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA828F54CBF958023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120223502:1":{"text":"특별한 이유? 잠깐, 네 뒤에 있는 녀석은... 소렌?","source_cn":"特殊的原因？等等——你后面的是，索恩？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DCE5C8F83A91D89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120223503:1":{"text":"저예요...","source_cn":"是我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x891163C65F5B34E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120223504:1":{"text":"...그렇다면 알겠군! 초코보의 깃털은 직접 뽑을 수 없지만 질주할 때 몇 개 떨어질 거야.","source_cn":"……那我明白了！陆行鸟的羽毛不能直接拔，但是它们在狂奔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FD19280CA27F242","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120223505:1":{"text":"그 깃털을 모으면 돼. 자, 방울을 빌려줄 테니, 초코보들을 뛰게 해봐.","source_cn":"那些羽毛你们可以直接收集，呐，铃铛借你们。让它们跑起来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A408BAB8AB7B034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fema